verses.commentary:
2:21-24 If one trusts in personal obedience, then that obedience must be complete (cf. Matt. 5:20;
Gal. 3:10, which is a quote from Deut. 27:26; 5:3; James 2:10). This is an impossibility for fallen mankind.
Paul asks poses rhetorical questions to his Jewish readers/hearers in Rom. 2:21-23.
